<title>CHILE: RESEARCH ALERT-Chilquinta upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Chilquinta upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santander Investment upgraded its rating on Chilean electric utility Chilquinta to market perform from sell.</p>
<p>Santander estimates its earnings per American Depositary Receipt at $1.20 this year, $1.32 next year and $1.54 in 1999. Chilquinta reported a 1996 earnings per ADR of $0.84.</p>
<p>Santander forecasts a 12- to 18-month target price of $16, implying 16 percent upside, including dividends.</p>
<p>--Santiago newsroom +56-2-699-5595 x211</p>
</text>
